<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p16.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p16.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. ”There is a well developed gliotic wall associated with this remote injury.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p16.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p16.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- This is <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p16.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">true</span> because the image shows a well gliotic wall, which is in the.</span></span>
