<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#808080;">Step: 256 (<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">Final result</span>):</span><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.1.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">think</span>&gt;<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To determine which statement is false, letś analyze each option:</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. “The differential diagnosis on this case is remote infarct vs. remote contusion.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- This is <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.5.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">true</span> because the image clearly shows a distant infarct from a distant location.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. “There is a well developed gliotic wall associated with this remote injury.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- This is <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.7.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">true</span> because the image shows a well developed gliotic wall, which is visible in the foreground.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. “The presence of macrophages is not helpful in distinguishing this from a subacute process.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.9" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.9.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- This is <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.9.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">false</span> because the image shows a subacute process with macrophages visible.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Therefore, the false statement is <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.10.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">C</span>.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.11.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">/think</span>&gt;<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p17.11.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">
