<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">To determine which statement is false, letś analyze each option:</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. ”The differential diagnosis on this case is vs. remote contusion.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">false</span> because the image clearly shows a.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. ”There is a well developed gliotic wall associated with this remote injury.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.6.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is because a well gliotic wall is a feature in the image.</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.7.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. ”The presence of macrophages is not helpful in distinguishing this from a subacute process.”</span></span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.8" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p18.8.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">This is’</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p12" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p12.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p12.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p12.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_leader" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:2.0pt;height:0.5pt;position:relative; bottom:0.0pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> </span><span id="A3.p3.pic1.p12.1.3" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
